iagnosis</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Focused assessment of symptoms, hormone levels and imaging to identify pituitary conditions as early as possible.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Pituitary tumour care</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Evaluation and treatment planning for pituitary tumours and other diseases of the gland.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Multidisciplinary team</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Care involves endocrinologists specialised in pituitary disease, neurosurgeons, neuroradiologists, neuropathologists, neuro-ophthalmologists, radiation oncologists, anaesthesiologists and supporting health staff.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Weekly case conferences</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Pituitary cases are discussed at regular multidisciplinary meetings, which external physicians can also attend with their own cases.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Education programmes</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The clinic runs educational programmes on pituitary disease for patients and physicians.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">International collaboration</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The clinic works together with international organisations in the field of pituitary disease.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Before you travel</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">To get a reliable medical opinion quickly, please prepare:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Recent medical reports and discharge summaries</li>\n\n<li>Imaging (MRI, CT, X-ray) on CD or as DICOM files, with the radiology reports</li>\n\n<li>Recent laboratory results</li>\n\n<li>A list of your current medications and any allergies</li>\n\n<li>Previous pituitary MRI scans on CD/DVD with reports</li>\n\n<li>Recent hormone test results</li>\n\n<li>Visual field test results, if available</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How MedLuxLife supports you</h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-steps is-layout-grid wp-container-core-group-is-layout-5e4b10ce wp-block-group-is-layout-grid\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Free consultation</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Share your wishes and, if available, recent X-rays or photos. We answer your questions and explain the options.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Personal treatment plan</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our partner specialists prepare a treatment plan and an estimated timeline tailored to you.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Travel &amp; treatment</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We coordinate your appointments, hotel and airport transfers, so you can focus on your treatment.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Aftercare</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We stay in touch after you return home and help with follow-up questions.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-cta has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Plan your Pituitary Clinic consultation with confidence</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Every treatment begins with a personal, no-obligation consultation. Contact us and we will get back to you as soon as possible.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://medluxlife.de/contact/\">Request a Free Consultation</a></div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-whatsapp\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://wa.me/380979092326\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WhatsApp</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"medlux-disclaimer wp-block-paragraph\">The information on this page is for general guidance only and does not replace a medical consultation. Suitability for any treatment is assessed individually by a qualified doctor.</p>\n</div>\n", "protected": false, "block_version": 1}, "excerpt": {"raw": "", "rendered": "<p>Pituitary disorders can be difficult to recognise because their symptoms often resemble other illnesses, so early and accurate diagnosis matters. This dedicated clinic brings several specialties together to evaluate pituitary diseases and tumours and to plan diagnosis and treatment using modern imaging, laboratory and treatment methods. MedLuxLife coordinates y